==Battleground==
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mobius (Enemy)|Mobius]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 28.67 seconds<sup>860f</sup>.
**2 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. On higher crowns, you may need to change your strategy to better adapt to the higher buffs of the enemies. Focus on slowly taking out the support units before engaging with Mobius.

